s father's Hindu beliefs. When his mother is killed in a communal riot, Ajay is forced to confront his past and reconcile his conflicted identity. The film explores themes of love, loss, and communal harmony against the backdrop of religious tensions in India.</desc><date>20260726</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a64a79ac7a8b65dff837987/images/LANDSCAPE_169/def14515-17bd-497f-a054-7d0d5298b3a7.png" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_39" start="20260726065354 +0000" stop="20260726090840 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_39_1785048834000_1785056920000"><title>Izzat</title><desc>Constable Ram Chandra teaches his son Siddharth to be a diligent policeman and lead his life with honesty and dignity. Siddharth follows his advice until circumstances force him to leave his ideals.</desc><date>20260726</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a64a79ac7a8b65dff83798b/images/LANDSCAPE_169/f73c4754-e223-460e-82f9-d6951aed04c7.png" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_39" start="20260726090841 +0000" stop="20260726120727 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_39_1785056921000_1785067647000"><title>Aa Gale Lag Jaa</title><desc>Roshni, a rich girl, is adamant on marrying Suraj, who is poor, until her mother reveals that his father is a former convict. Later, people around them are brutally killed by a seemingly unstoppable assailant.</desc><date>20260726</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a64a79ac7a8b65dff83798e/images/LANDSCAPE_169/f82442eb-093c-4331-8a78-b89946970d9a.png" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_39" start="20260726120727 +0000" stop="20260726151101 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_39_1785067647000_1785078661000"><title>Dastaan</title><desc>Vishnu, a reputed judge, is assumed to be Anil, an absconding murderer. However, he decides to travel to Anil's home town and unravel the mystery